      "text": "[9:11PM] #Imota_Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nSabo Roundabout to Itamaga, traffic has subsided, with improved movement.\nItamaga to Imota is good movement, with good vehicular flow.\nItamaga to Elepe (via Idiroko, Cele, Gbaga, Omiitoro, and Eleshin) is good movement.\n\nReturn journey from Elepe to Itamaga (via Eleshin, Omiitoro, Gbaga, Cele, and Idiroko) is a faster movement.\nItamaga to Sabo Roundabout (via Sawmill, Nasfat, Jendol, Low-Cost Housing Estate, Alaka, and Sabo Onimalu) is a better movement.\n\nNo record of any impediments or disruptions, ensuring a smooth traffic flow throughout the axis.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
