      "text": "[9:20PM] #IyanaIpaja #TrafficUpdate \n\nAlaagba to Iyana Ipaja Roundabout, traffic congestion has subsided, with vehicular movement transitioning to a fast-paced flow.\nNew Ipaja Road, good movement observed in both inward and outward directions.\n\nLagos-Abeokuta Expressway is good movement from Danco to Goye, with encouraging traffic flow on the return journey inward Pleasure, despite brief delays under the Iyana Ipaja flyover bridge due to pedestrian and bustop activities.\n\nMovement at Mosalasi to Isheri Roundabout via Egbeda is fast-moving traffic with no delays at the Egbeda alternation point, with similar conditions observed on the return journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
