      "text": "[9:27PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Abule-Ado through Ojo Barracks, Volkswagen, Afolabi Ege Fruits market down to Iyana Iba intersection.\n\nAlso, good movement along Lasu Igando road from Iyana Iba intersection to First Gate, Ipaye, Iyana school down to Obadore bridge.\n\nReturn journey back to Iyana Iba under bridge is also good.\n\nMeanwhile, we have fast movement inward Badagry Expressway from Alaba Rago, Okokomaiko, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era, Vespa down to Custom Checkpoint Ijanikin.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
