      "text": "[9:55PM] #Ketu #TrafficUpdate \n\nAppreciable Movement from Ojota to Interchange.\nGood movement ascending the bridge to Toll Gate.\n\nGood Movement from Interchange to Tipper Garage.\nDemuren to Ile Ile, Iyana School, Kosofe, and Mile 12 is good movement\n\nApproaching Demuren Junction, there's a minor delay due to pedestrian crossing and commercial activities\n\nReturn Journey from Iyana School to Ojota is good, with smooth movement through Ikosi Junction, Fruit Market, and Interchange\n\nOfficers are actively on ground, managing traffic effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
